(519553, 51614, 6388, '<td valign="top">you were right...it IS the colors of christmas :)  i like it...one of the few true macros in the challenge.  i like the contrastiness (i know, not a word).   very edgy...literally - i like that.  great job.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'you were right...it IS the colors of christmas :)  i like it...one of the few true macros in the challenge.  i like the contrastiness (i know, not a word).   very edgy...literally - i like that.  great job. Pedro', '2003-12-22 01:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
