(519559, 51689, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and dof, great colors and lovely subject. I''d like to see it with the shadow/highlight boosted a little bit. Composition is good too. 7</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and dof, great colors and lovely subject. I''d like to see it with the shadow/highlight boosted a little bit. Composition is good too. 7', '2003-12-22 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(519565, 51286, 6388, '<td valign="top">who you callin a massi...oh...never mind.  nice pic - i like the shallow depth...makes a rather mundane subject a little obscure.  minimal border is nice also.  compositionally it is a bit of a stretch...i guess i''m trying to say i''d like to have a reason OTHER than a macro challenge to be looking at this...although i have yet to find it in this challenge. :)  technically right on the money - great job.</td>', 'who you callin a massi...oh...never mind.  nice pic - i like the shallow depth...makes a rather mundane subject a little obscure.  minimal border is nice also.  compositionally it is a bit of a stretch...i guess i''m trying to say i''d like to have a reason OTHER than a macro challenge to be looking at this...although i have yet to find it in this challenge. :)  technically right on the money - great job.', '2003-12-22 02:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(519566, 51019, 6388, '<td valign="top">damn you people who live in places warm enough to still have bugs.  or did you freeze one like jacko? anyway - this is great...similar to things done by the likes of Crabappl and quadrajet very successfuly in the past (if memory serves).  love the crop - seems to comply with rule of thirds (though i hate rules)...colour is inviting, and the focus is spot on.  I see this doing very well this week.</td>', 'damn you people who live in places warm enough to still have bugs.  or did you freeze one like jacko? anyway - this is great...similar to things done by the likes of Crabappl and quadrajet very successfuly in the past (if memory serves).  love the crop - seems to comply with rule of thirds (though i hate rules)...colour is inviting, and the focus is spot on.  I see this doing very well this week.', '2003-12-22 02:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(519567, 51181, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice take on an odd subject.  way overdone on the border.  colour and depth are nice...use of neg space also nice.  i have no idea what you''d do with such an object.  Pedro</td>', 'nice take on an odd subject.  way overdone on the border.  colour and depth are nice...use of neg space also nice.  i have no idea what you''d do with such an object.  Pedro', '2003-12-22 02:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(519568, 51508, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice documentary, but lacks artistic appeal for me.  technically seems fine, though it actually looks a little edited at the back - maybe just compression artifacts.  i might have tried this at a much lower angle...throw some perspective into the mix.  good luck.  Pedro</td>', 'nice documentary, but lacks artistic appeal for me.  technically seems fine, though it actually looks a little edited at the back - maybe just compression artifacts.  i might have tried this at a much lower angle...throw some perspective into the mix.  good luck.  Pedro', '2003-12-22 02:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(519569, 50991, 12160, '<td valign="top">I love the curvature goes down from the left and up to the right corner. I find it hard to see it as a pepper, perhaps there isn''t a lot of contrast to make a strong b&amp;w.</td>', 'I love the curvature goes down from the left and up to the right corner. I find it hard to see it as a pepper, perhaps there isn''t a lot of contrast to make a strong b&w.', '2003-12-22 02:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(519571, 51607, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great colors. Great work.</td>', 'Nice composition and great colors. Great work.', '2003-12-22 02:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(519572, 50973, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like this, though I''d have taken it from a more head-on angle...not straigt head on, but towards the front.  the shallow depth works since you hit your focal point bang on.nice texture on the frog.  Pedro</td>', 'i like this, though I''d have taken it from a more head-on angle...not straigt head on, but towards the front.  the shallow depth works since you hit your focal point bang on.nice texture on the frog.  Pedro', '2003-12-22 02:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
