(519820, 51473, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- though a more dynamic lighting of the subject might have made this shot even stronger.<br/> <br/>Personal: Really pretty. I like the abstract feel of this shot. <br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- though a more dynamic lighting of the subject might have made this shot even stronger. Personal: Really pretty. I like the abstract feel of this shot.  My vote: 8', '2003-12-22 09:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
