(519832, 51658, 9941, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea... it took me a few moments to figure out what it was.  One of the best of the lot.</td>', 'Interesting idea... it took me a few moments to figure out what it was.  One of the best of the lot.', '2003-12-22 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(519834, 51428, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good DOF.  I have to wonder if your score is diminished by the subject matter?</td>', 'Nice shot, good DOF.  I have to wonder if your score is diminished by the subject matter?', '2003-12-22 09:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(519835, 51108, 9941, '<td valign="top">This is the third or fourth leaf I''ve seen in this challenge, and I think I like yours the best.  The focus is excellent.</td>', 'This is the third or fourth leaf I''ve seen in this challenge, and I think I like yours the best.  The focus is excellent.', '2003-12-22 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(519836, 51545, 9941, '<td valign="top">Fun, colorful, and very entertaining.</td>', 'Fun, colorful, and very entertaining.', '2003-12-22 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(519837, 51685, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent.<br/> <br/>Personal: Sometimes a detail image like this one loses me because I can''t tell what it is and therefore can''t make any sort of emotional "attachment". But if it''s well done then it stands on it''s own as a great abstract. For me, this one is very well done. The colors and shapes are just killer. I''m looking forward to finding out what this was (and is it reflected in a mirror) when the challenge ends.<br/> <br/>My vote: 10</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. Personal: Sometimes a detail image like this one loses me because I can''t tell what it is and therefore can''t make any sort of emotional "attachment". But if it''s well done then it stands on it''s own as a great abstract. For me, this one is very well done. The colors and shapes are just killer. I''m looking forward to finding out what this was (and is it reflected in a mirror) when the challenge ends. My vote: 10', '2003-12-22 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(519838, 51687, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp point.  Nice clarity and sharpness.  Might have been a little crisper toward the top if a smaller aperture was used but really small apertures are sometimes hard to come by on digital cameras. You may have used a small aperture but the DOF is so shallow because of being so close to subject too.(?)  I have tried this type of show in the past without much success so I am impressed.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Nice sharp point.  Nice clarity and sharpness.  Might have been a little crisper toward the top if a smaller aperture was used but really small apertures are sometimes hard to come by on digital cameras. You may have used a small aperture but the DOF is so shallow because of being so close to subject too.(?)  I have tried this type of show in the past without much success so I am impressed.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-22 09:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(519839, 51516, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Looks overexposed. Composition is good. I think focus is off. Lighting seems good, though it''s hard to tell.<br/> <br/>Personal: Not a strong enough shot to me- more time spent might have yielded a better photo.<br/> <br/>My vote: 2</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Looks overexposed. Composition is good. I think focus is off. Lighting seems good, though it''s hard to tell. Personal: Not a strong enough shot to me- more time spent might have yielded a better photo. My vote: 2', '2003-12-22 09:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(519841, 51824, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the layered feel to it.  The gradient effect is also nice.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the layered feel to it.  The gradient effect is also nice.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2003-12-22 09:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
