(519992, 51777, 10819, '<td valign="top">this shot is very nice...very original take.</td>', 'this shot is very nice...very original take.', '2003-12-22 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(519993, 51567, 15291, '<td valign="top">Total lack of detail in the eye looks more like a black hole. My eye was immediatly drawn to the reflection in the eye which looks like it might be a window. There is a big difference in catch light &amp; reflection.</td>', 'Total lack of detail in the eye looks more like a black hole. My eye was immediatly drawn to the reflection in the eye which looks like it might be a window. There is a big difference in catch light & reflection.', '2003-12-22 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(520010, 51746, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice Abstract !...doesn''t belong in macro.</td>', 'Nice Abstract !...doesn''t belong in macro.', '2003-12-22 13:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(520027, 51719, 12962, '<td valign="top">I am partial to jellyfish images and I will have to admit that I will be biased here.  Having said that, I have to commend the photographer for this photograph because of the clarity of the details.  It is very difficult to photograph jellyfish with this kind of detail because they are constantly moving around.  The ''hairs'' are amazing.  In many other jellyfish photographs that I have seen, the ''hairs'' are kind of fuzzy.   DOF is excellent, colors are beautiful ... and especially, the way the aquarium lighting was caught is very wise and appropriate - it did not overwhelm the main subject and thus afforded contrast and clarity.</td>', 'I am partial to jellyfish images and I will have to admit that I will be biased here.  Having said that, I have to commend the photographer for this photograph because of the clarity of the details.  It is very difficult to photograph jellyfish with this kind of detail because they are constantly moving around.  The ''hairs'' are amazing.  In many other jellyfish photographs that I have seen, the ''hairs'' are kind of fuzzy.   DOF is excellent, colors are beautiful ... and especially, the way the aquarium lighting was caught is very wise and appropriate - it did not overwhelm the main subject and thus afforded contrast and clarity.', '2003-12-22 14:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(520029, 51823, 12962, '<td valign="top">Texture ... texture ... texture ... that''s what makes this photograph.</td>', 'Texture ... texture ... texture ... that''s what makes this photograph.', '2003-12-22 14:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(520031, 51604, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely color.</td>', 'Lovely color.', '2003-12-22 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(520032, 51519, 6130, '<td valign="top">Good.</td>', 'Good.', '2003-12-22 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(520033, 51299, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-12-22 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(520035, 51169, 9448, '<td valign="top">Did you try a slightly tighter crop (Too much white space on right for me)?  Good focus.  I like the colourisation.  Looks a little noisy.</td>', 'Did you try a slightly tighter crop (Too much white space on right for me)?  Good focus.  I like the colourisation.  Looks a little noisy.', '2003-12-22 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(520038, 51438, 9448, '<td valign="top">I am not sure, but this looks just like a close-up of the normal wallpaper to me.</td>', 'I am not sure, but this looks just like a close-up of the normal wallpaper to me.', '2003-12-22 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(520040, 51656, 9448, '<td valign="top">Interesting, maybe you could have used one of the pine branches to draw more attention to the light.  Nice composition.  Good focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting, maybe you could have used one of the pine branches to draw more attention to the light.  Nice composition.  Good focus.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 14:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(520041, 51770, 9448, '<td valign="top">Good composition, very good use of the branches to draw your attention towards the subject.  Also very good use of nice warm lighting -- good to see that used to good effect here.  A bit of a shame about the blown out highlights, I would be tempted to underexposed these sorts of pictures as shadow detail can be rescued, whereas highlights cannot.  Definitely a case for shooting in raw mode if your camera supports it.  Well done.Good luck.</td>', 'Good composition, very good use of the branches to draw your attention towards the subject.  Also very good use of nice warm lighting -- good to see that used to good effect here.  A bit of a shame about the blown out highlights, I would be tempted to underexposed these sorts of pictures as shadow detail can be rescued, whereas highlights cannot.  Definitely a case for shooting in raw mode if your camera supports it.  Well done.Good luck.', '2003-12-22 14:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(520042, 51209, 9448, '<td valign="top">There is a strange lined effect in the background that I am not sure that I am keen on.  The lighting also does not bring out the detail (which if that was your intention that I am sorry) which I think is a bitter shame.  Nice composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'There is a strange lined effect in the background that I am not sure that I am keen on.  The lighting also does not bring out the detail (which if that was your intention that I am sorry) which I think is a bitter shame.  Nice composition.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(520043, 51582, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great shadows and tones.  Nice details.  B&amp;W was a great way to go with this photo.</td>', 'Great shadows and tones.  Nice details.  B&W was a great way to go with this photo.', '2003-12-22 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(520044, 51770, 14620, '<td valign="top">This picture is so crisp and clear.  I love the way the sunlight is used here.  Very Pretty!</td>', 'This picture is so crisp and clear.  I love the way the sunlight is used here.  Very Pretty!', '2003-12-22 14:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(520045, 51706, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great museum photography we''ve got here.  I wish that the spotlight is a little bit wider to give more light to the back tines but I am just being petty.  Framing is good too.</td>', 'Great museum photography we''ve got here.  I wish that the spotlight is a little bit wider to give more light to the back tines but I am just being petty.  Framing is good too.', '2003-12-22 14:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(520046, 51824, 9448, '<td valign="top">I really like the fill the frame effect in this picture, I also like the composition and the balance.  I like the way that the lower petals point you to the lovely warm colour in the lefthand side of this picture.  What I feel lets this picture down is that it is somewhat noisy, and that the very bottom righthand corner adds nothing to the picture and is just a distraction.<br/>Nice composition.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the fill the frame effect in this picture, I also like the composition and the balance.  I like the way that the lower petals point you to the lovely warm colour in the lefthand side of this picture.  What I feel lets this picture down is that it is somewhat noisy, and that the very bottom righthand corner adds nothing to the picture and is just a distraction.Nice composition.  Well done.', '2003-12-22 14:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(520054, 51687, 9448, '<td valign="top">Good use of composition and lighting, nice effect.  Interesting patchy background.  I''m guessing that you used a Canon 10D with a 50 millimetre F 1.8 lens and extension tubes.</td>', 'Good use of composition and lighting, nice effect.  Interesting patchy background.  I''m guessing that you used a Canon 10D with a 50 millimetre F 1.8 lens and extension tubes.', '2003-12-22 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(520057, 51761, 9448, '<td valign="top">A good fill the frame shot, the needles of the cactus contrast very well with the green of the cactus.  I would however say that your picture lacks a single point to focus -- maybe a shot more along the edge of the cactus with a shallow depth of field would work better in this case?<br/> <br/>Also a lot of your highlights are quite blown out, and suffer from chromatic aberrations.  Sticking with the picture that you have got, I think the picture may well have worked better if you crop tightly to the main bud on the left of the cactus.  You would have removed the distracting colour from the lower right and also a lot of the blown out detail on the left.  I also feel that you could have underexposed this picture by about to stop and corrected the brightness later on in Photoshop, this would deal with the blown out detail and some of the chromatic aberrations.<br/> <br/>My main concern is the point to focus however.  I do however like the lighting and the way that it brings out the different shades of green in the cactus itself.  Good luck.</td>', 'A good fill the frame shot, the needles of the cactus contrast very well with the green of the cactus.  I would however say that your picture lacks a single point to focus -- maybe a shot more along the edge of the cactus with a shallow depth of field would work better in this case? Also a lot of your highlights are quite blown out, and suffer from chromatic aberrations.  Sticking with the picture that you have got, I think the picture may well have worked better if you crop tightly to the main bud on the left of the cactus.  You would have removed the distracting colour from the lower right and also a lot of the blown out detail on the left.  I also feel that you could have underexposed this picture by about to stop and corrected the brightness later on in Photoshop, this would deal with the blown out detail and some of the chromatic aberrations. My main concern is the point to focus however.  I do however like the lighting and the way that it brings out the different shades of green in the cactus itself.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(520059, 51541, 9448, '<td valign="top">Good effort arranging the jars, good depth of field and nice focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good effort arranging the jars, good depth of field and nice focus.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(520062, 51645, 9448, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what this picture is trying to convey or what the exact focus point is supposed to be on.  Sorry if I missed the point.<br/>Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.</td>', 'I am not sure what this picture is trying to convey or what the exact focus point is supposed to be on.  Sorry if I missed the point.Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(520063, 51545, 5783, '<td valign="top">nice colours :)</td>', 'nice colours :)', '2003-12-22 15:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(520065, 51000, 9448, '<td valign="top">With the chromatic aberrations that you got you may have benefited from stopping down your aperture a little bit, or using a slightly more telephoto setting.  It might also help to underexpose the image and then brighten it up later on in an image editing program.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.</td>', 'With the chromatic aberrations that you got you may have benefited from stopping down your aperture a little bit, or using a slightly more telephoto setting.  It might also help to underexpose the image and then brighten it up later on in an image editing program.  Looks a little noisy.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(520070, 51826, 12962, '<td valign="top">The abstract quality of this photograph is excellent.  I like how this part of the fish fills up the frame.  DOF is good.  Colors are vivid and grab you right away.</td>', 'The abstract quality of this photograph is excellent.  I like how this part of the fish fills up the frame.  DOF is good.  Colors are vivid and grab you right away.', '2003-12-22 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(520071, 51167, 12962, '<td valign="top">Tricolor works well.  I just wish the focus is more on the button rather than the thread to the left of the button.</td>', 'Tricolor works well.  I just wish the focus is more on the button rather than the thread to the left of the button.', '2003-12-22 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(520072, 51740, 5783, '<td valign="top">very nice , this will do well</td>', 'very nice , this will do well', '2003-12-22 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(520073, 51332, 9448, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot with a lot of potential and done in quite a good way.  I''m impressed that you successfully managed to limit the amount of chromatic aberrations that you got.<br/> <br/>If you could achieve it then I think that you should have attempted to get depth of field of just one knife and throw all the others out of focus.  If this was impossible with your camera then maybe you should have tried to get a depth of field so that all of the knives were in focus.<br/> <br/>I am okay with the composition that you have, but I do think that you have too much negative space at the top of your picture for a properly balanced image.  Also as macro is a fantastic way of isolating just a tiny part of a larger object I was wondering whether or not you had tried a very tight crop of just the blades of the knives?  I just held up a couple of pieces of paper to my screen and used one hand to get a very tight crop -- I feel that it makes the picture more interesting and makes it harder to tell what you''re looking at.  If you have not tried this then I really do suggest that you try it.  If I did not explain that very well, then sent me the picture and I will send you back a copy of what I mean.<br/> <br/>Good picture with a lot of potential, and well edited.  Good luck.</td>', 'An interesting shot with a lot of potential and done in quite a good way.  I''m impressed that you successfully managed to limit the amount of chromatic aberrations that you got. If you could achieve it then I think that you should have attempted to get depth of field of just one knife and throw all the others out of focus.  If this was impossible with your camera then maybe you should have tried to get a depth of field so that all of the knives were in focus. I am okay with the composition that you have, but I do think that you have too much negative space at the top of your picture for a properly balanced image.  Also as macro is a fantastic way of isolating just a tiny part of a larger object I was wondering whether or not you had tried a very tight crop of just the blades of the knives?  I just held up a couple of pieces of paper to my screen and used one hand to get a very tight crop -- I feel that it makes the picture more interesting and makes it harder to tell what you''re looking at.  If you have not tried this then I really do suggest that you try it.  If I did not explain that very well, then sent me the picture and I will send you back a copy of what I mean. Good picture with a lot of potential, and well edited.  Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(520075, 51683, 9448, '<td valign="top">A clever shot and a good idea, well executed.  Looking very British (that is if the next on the watch is the manufacturer) it is a shame that the picture is slightly noisy.</td>', 'A clever shot and a good idea, well executed.  Looking very British (that is if the next on the watch is the manufacturer) it is a shame that the picture is slightly noisy.', '2003-12-22 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(520076, 51721, 5783, '<td valign="top">wow nice shot</td>', 'wow nice shot', '2003-12-22 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(520079, 51746, 9448, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea -- I assume that your main focus was on the colourful reflections of light?  If this is the case then I am finding it a little bit difficult to pick out an exact point of focus, if I''m wrong then I guess and missed the point of the picture.<br/> <br/>Good black background, I''m assuming you either have an expensive camera or that you edited it later on.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'An interesting idea -- I assume that your main focus was on the colourful reflections of light?  If this is the case then I am finding it a little bit difficult to pick out an exact point of focus, if I''m wrong then I guess and missed the point of the picture. Good black background, I''m assuming you either have an expensive camera or that you edited it later on. Good luck.', '2003-12-22 15:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(520084, 51370, 5783, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of colours ,a supberb shot</td>', 'nice contrast of colours ,a supberb shot', '2003-12-22 15:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(520086, 51604, 12962, '<td valign="top">It''s eerie ... wonderful job in desaturating and changing colors!</td>', 'It''s eerie ... wonderful job in desaturating and changing colors!', '2003-12-22 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(520087, 51710, 12962, '<td valign="top">Could be included in a stock photography collection.  Good job!</td>', 'Could be included in a stock photography collection.  Good job!', '2003-12-22 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(520088, 51286, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the title ... very naughty :-).</td>', 'I like the title ... very naughty :-).', '2003-12-22 16:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(520091, 51678, 5783, '<td valign="top">looks like one of my mother inlaws whiskers.........awseome shot 10</td>', 'looks like one of my mother inlaws whiskers.........awseome shot 10', '2003-12-22 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(520097, 51760, 9448, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of picture that I think really benefits for a symmetrical composition, so I find your choice of an asymmetrical composition quite interesting.  I would also have preferred to see the entire bud in the depth of field and in good focus.  Your picture is also a little bit too noisy.<br/> <br/>You have got very nice and close to the flower however, and I am aware of how difficult it is to attain good focus and depth of field from such a vantage point.<br/> <br/>Your picture would also benefit from being rotated clockwise a few degrees to level off the bottom of the petals and the top of the bud.<br/> <br/>You have however attained a very lovely silky smooth white background with the petals, and that really does add to the shot.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'This is the sort of picture that I think really benefits for a symmetrical composition, so I find your choice of an asymmetrical composition quite interesting.  I would also have preferred to see the entire bud in the depth of field and in good focus.  Your picture is also a little bit too noisy. You have got very nice and close to the flower however, and I am aware of how difficult it is to attain good focus and depth of field from such a vantage point. Your picture would also benefit from being rotated clockwise a few degrees to level off the bottom of the petals and the top of the bud. You have however attained a very lovely silky smooth white background with the petals, and that really does add to the shot. Good luck.', '2003-12-22 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(520098, 51580, 12962, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing  ... colors are beautiful.  There seems to be a gray cast that may perhaps be reduced by boosting contrast a little bit ... but if this is the intent of the picture, then, it should be ok.</td>', 'Interesting framing  ... colors are beautiful.  There seems to be a gray cast that may perhaps be reduced by boosting contrast a little bit ... but if this is the intent of the picture, then, it should be ok.', '2003-12-22 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(520100, 51701, 12962, '<td valign="top">I love the black that you chose a stark black background ... it  accentuates the delicate character of the flowers.  The white is pure, the petals soft, the clarity of the main flower subject is exceptional ... you can almost touch the petals and be dusted with pollen.  Great job!</td>', 'I love the black that you chose a stark black background ... it  accentuates the delicate character of the flowers.  The white is pure, the petals soft, the clarity of the main flower subject is exceptional ... you can almost touch the petals and be dusted with pollen.  Great job!', '2003-12-22 16:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(520102, 51508, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good framing, good composition, DOF is adquate, colors are warm.  Nice!</td>', 'Good framing, good composition, DOF is adquate, colors are warm.  Nice!', '2003-12-22 16:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(520104, 51128, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  The front cacti are a little bit distracting, IMHO, and their role in the picture could be reduced by cropping about an inch and a half from the bottom so that your main elements would get more attention.</td>', 'Nice subject.  The front cacti are a little bit distracting, IMHO, and their role in the picture could be reduced by cropping about an inch and a half from the bottom so that your main elements would get more attention.', '2003-12-22 16:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(520106, 50973, 12962, '<td valign="top">As a biologist, this photograph interests me very much.  The frog is so real, you can just ''feel'' its soft, perhaps slimy skin ... but it seems like its ready to jump away from you.  Be careful now.  DOF is good, lighting is perfect ... I like it that you offset the frog toward the side ... to give him more room for the impending movement ... very very pleasing.  Congratulations!</td>', 'As a biologist, this photograph interests me very much.  The frog is so real, you can just ''feel'' its soft, perhaps slimy skin ... but it seems like its ready to jump away from you.  Be careful now.  DOF is good, lighting is perfect ... I like it that you offset the frog toward the side ... to give him more room for the impending movement ... very very pleasing.  Congratulations!', '2003-12-22 16:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(520107, 51333, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the details that you were able to extract from the feathers ... but the shadow in front is a little bit distracting as it takes about a third of the picture.  But the details and texture are wonderful.</td>', 'I like the details that you were able to extract from the feathers ... but the shadow in front is a little bit distracting as it takes about a third of the picture.  But the details and texture are wonderful.', '2003-12-22 16:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(520110, 51557, 12160, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, too bad the face was shadowed. Focus is good and composition on the diagonal is appealling.</td>', 'I like this shot, too bad the face was shadowed. Focus is good and composition on the diagonal is appealling.', '2003-12-22 16:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(520111, 51108, 12962, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Very mesmerizing.  The coloration, definition and shadowing of the veins are remarkable.  It''s like following a maze.  The glare at the bottom center is a little bit distracting and could probably be cropped just at the level of the 2nd rib from the bottom.  But I am just being petty.  Good job!</td>', 'Cool.  Very mesmerizing.  The coloration, definition and shadowing of the veins are remarkable.  It''s like following a maze.  The glare at the bottom center is a little bit distracting and could probably be cropped just at the level of the 2nd rib from the bottom.  But I am just being petty.  Good job!', '2003-12-22 16:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(520115, 51698, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good subject, couple of hot spots in the photo. Composition and color are good.</td>', 'Nice idea, good subject, couple of hot spots in the photo. Composition and color are good.', '2003-12-22 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(520117, 51688, 13091, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF</td>', 'Nice use of DOF', '2003-12-22 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(520118, 51777, 13091, '<td valign="top">I love that one. 9...</td>', 'I love that one. 9...', '2003-12-22 16:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(520120, 51211, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great colors. I like the clarity of the main subject. The source of light made the right portion of the photo hazy causing a little bit of distraction.</td>', 'Nice photo, great colors. I like the clarity of the main subject. The source of light made the right portion of the photo hazy causing a little bit of distraction.', '2003-12-22 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(520122, 51717, 12962, '<td valign="top">The starkness of this composition ... is very powerful.</td>', 'The starkness of this composition ... is very powerful.', '2003-12-22 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
