(520419, 51685, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool effect using ordinary objects.  The lighting is very nice.  I''m wondering if this is actually 2 or one set up against a mirror?  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'This is a really cool effect using ordinary objects.  The lighting is very nice.  I''m wondering if this is actually 2 or one set up against a mirror?  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-22 21:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(520433, 51514, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  Awesome capture.  Really nice clarity for what I am sure was a tough shot to capture to begin with.  I really like the way the greys work together and seems de-saturated and the bread really stands out because of it''s difference is color.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'This is really cool.  Awesome capture.  Really nice clarity for what I am sure was a tough shot to capture to begin with.  I really like the way the greys work together and seems de-saturated and the bread really stands out because of it''s difference is color.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2003-12-22 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(520441, 51753, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot.  I like that you didn''t just do a super close up of the ball and included the glove as well.  Very nice.  I can see this hanging on the wall in a sports bar or some place like that.  I also like that you didn''t use a brand new ball and used a ball that looks as though it has been used a bit.  Good luck and I hope you finish well.</td>', 'I really enjoy this shot.  I like that you didn''t just do a super close up of the ball and included the glove as well.  Very nice.  I can see this hanging on the wall in a sports bar or some place like that.  I also like that you didn''t use a brand new ball and used a ball that looks as though it has been used a bit.  Good luck and I hope you finish well.', '2003-12-22 21:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
