(520509, 51799, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love it.  It''s as if one is invading the private life of this particular orchid.  The diagonals invite my eyes to dig deeper into the inside ... which is so inviting because of the light.  Co(o)lors are wild  (congratulations in your manipulations!).  Texture of the petals is well captured ... delicate and soft.  Orchids are so exquisite ... and so is this picture.</td>', 'Love it.  It''s as if one is invading the private life of this particular orchid.  The diagonals invite my eyes to dig deeper into the inside ... which is so inviting because of the light.  Co(o)lors are wild  (congratulations in your manipulations!).  Texture of the petals is well captured ... delicate and soft.  Orchids are so exquisite ... and so is this picture.', '2003-12-22 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(520512, 51629, 7485, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this a Danaeid?  They usually appear to have 4 legs like this with one short pair tucked up tight.  Also, Papilionids are sort of furry-looking.  (This is Magnus'' biologist houseguest writing.)</td>', 'Isn''t this a Danaeid?  They usually appear to have 4 legs like this with one short pair tucked up tight.  Also, Papilionids are sort of furry-looking.  (This is Magnus'' biologist houseguest writing.)', '2003-12-22 23:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
