(520769, 51689, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast between the black background and the reds and could probably benefit by increasing the contrast more.  BTW, the title is VERY appropriate but it took me a long time to get it ... until I realized the flowers have these lip like structures and they appear to be singing to their hearts'' content!  Wonderful capture!  I just wish there is a way to highlight these lips more because they really make the picture!</td>', 'Beautiful contrast between the black background and the reds and could probably benefit by increasing the contrast more.  BTW, the title is VERY appropriate but it took me a long time to get it ... until I realized the flowers have these lip like structures and they appear to be singing to their hearts'' content!  Wonderful capture!  I just wish there is a way to highlight these lips more because they really make the picture!', '2003-12-23 09:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
