(520772, 51721, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent.<br/> <br/>Personal: ugh.... this givem me the creeps! I don''t want to know what flies look like up close! But it''s definitely an excellent shot. I''ll be interested to know what equipment you shot this with- I don''t think I could get a shot like this with my camera!<br/> <br/>My vote: 9</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. Personal: ugh.... this givem me the creeps! I don''t want to know what flies look like up close! But it''s definitely an excellent shot. I''ll be interested to know what equipment you shot this with- I don''t think I could get a shot like this with my camera! My vote: 9', '2003-12-23 09:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(520773, 51706, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: most likely fits the challenge, though with no knowledge of the actual size of the subject I can''t tell for sure. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent- I love the lighting. I''ll be interested to know what the source was.<br/> <br/>Personal: A very effective shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8</td>', 'Technical: most likely fits the challenge, though with no knowledge of the actual size of the subject I can''t tell for sure. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent- I love the lighting. I''ll be interested to know what the source was. Personal: A very effective shot. My vote: 8', '2003-12-23 09:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(520774, 51820, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure looks a little undercooked, composition could be stronger, focus seems a little soft, lighting seems a bit dim.<br/> <br/>Personal: With no depth to the subject itself it''s impossible to tell that it''s concave, if it weren''t for the title. It looks like a dressed up slice of glass fruit to me. Taken from a different angle this shot might have been stronger.<br/> <br/>My vote: 2</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure looks a little undercooked, composition could be stronger, focus seems a little soft, lighting seems a bit dim. Personal: With no depth to the subject itself it''s impossible to tell that it''s concave, if it weren''t for the title. It looks like a dressed up slice of glass fruit to me. Taken from a different angle this shot might have been stronger. My vote: 2', '2003-12-23 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(520776, 51710, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good.<br/> <br/>Personal: Normally I have a hard time with shots that don''t have a single subject to focus on, but in this case it works. The soft focus is a nice juxtaposition with the metal works. I like it!<br/> <br/>My vote: 7</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good. Personal: Normally I have a hard time with shots that don''t have a single subject to focus on, but in this case it works. The soft focus is a nice juxtaposition with the metal works. I like it! My vote: 7', '2003-12-23 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(520778, 51622, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: Looks like the front of a Hallmark card!<br/> <br/>My vote: 6</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. Personal: Looks like the front of a Hallmark card! My vote: 6', '2003-12-23 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(520782, 51438, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Looks a bit underexposed. Composition is a little extreme for a vase that doesn''t have more flowing lines. With no top or bottom my eye follows the edge of the vase right out of the shot. Focus is good, lighting is flat.<br/> <br/>Personal: With as close to the vase is to the background, they''re both in relatively sharp focus- I find myself investigating the wall as much as the vase itself. I think moving the vase away from the background and giving it some more dynamic lighting would''ve helped this shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 3</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Looks a bit underexposed. Composition is a little extreme for a vase that doesn''t have more flowing lines. With no top or bottom my eye follows the edge of the vase right out of the shot. Focus is good, lighting is flat. Personal: With as close to the vase is to the background, they''re both in relatively sharp focus- I find myself investigating the wall as much as the vase itself. I think moving the vase away from the background and giving it some more dynamic lighting would''ve helped this shot. My vote: 3', '2003-12-23 09:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(520797, 51718, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: The selective color with either be loved or hated.  Personally I like it, but don''t see a purpose. The title doesn''t support it, and by the eye being in color it took me longer to realize there were tears. First I investigated the eye color, then the mascaa, then I realized her eye was wet. While there isn''t much face here, she doesn''t appear to have a "blue" expression.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5</td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. Personal: The selective color with either be loved or hated.  Personally I like it, but don''t see a purpose. The title doesn''t support it, and by the eye being in color it took me longer to realize there were tears. First I investigated the eye color, then the mascaa, then I realized her eye was wet. While there isn''t much face here, she doesn''t appear to have a "blue" expression. My vote: 5', '2003-12-23 09:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
