(521269, 51805, 6600, '<td valign="top">Colorful coin (a bit out of focus?).... It is hard to achieve any ''real'' composition with a shot like this (in a 2D plane).  Possible critique: The shot could have been made more interesting (for example) by standing the coin on edge and illuminating it so as to cast a shadow beyond, adding another element to the shot.</td>', 'Colorful coin (a bit out of focus?).... It is hard to achieve any ''real'' composition with a shot like this (in a 2D plane).  Possible critique: The shot could have been made more interesting (for example) by standing the coin on edge and illuminating it so as to cast a shadow beyond, adding another element to the shot.', '2003-12-23 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
