(521473, 51689, 7778, '<td valign="top">You''ll need a well calibrated monitor to enjoy this entry in its full glory. The subtle lighting is very apt for this range of deep reds, indeed. As a macro, the magnification of detail is remarkable and the degree of depth of field synchronizes perfectly with the focus achieved here.<br/> <br/>This entry strikes me not only as a technically accomplished piece, but also as a mature and well-rounded photo for crisp interest it evolves from a subject most can be expected to be familiar with.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>.</td>', 'You''ll need a well calibrated monitor to enjoy this entry in its full glory. The subtle lighting is very apt for this range of deep reds, indeed. As a macro, the magnification of detail is remarkable and the degree of depth of field synchronizes perfectly with the focus achieved here. This entry strikes me not only as a technically accomplished piece, but also as a mature and well-rounded photo for crisp interest it evolves from a subject most can be expected to be familiar with.   .', '2003-12-23 23:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
