(521780, 51511, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the color and the subject.  Would like to have seen a more dynamic composition, but overall, I like this a lot. 8</td>', 'Love the color and the subject.  Would like to have seen a more dynamic composition, but overall, I like this a lot. 8', '2003-12-24 04:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(521781, 51706, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the lighting, and hope you share details in your comments.   Visually engaging and well done. 9</td>', 'Absolutely love the lighting, and hope you share details in your comments.   Visually engaging and well done. 9', '2003-12-24 04:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(521783, 51498, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  Love the lighting and the wonderful color. 8</td>', 'Beautifully done!  Love the lighting and the wonderful color. 8', '2003-12-24 04:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521784, 51649, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  The lighting is wonderful.  9</td>', 'Very nicely done!  The lighting is wonderful.  9', '2003-12-24 05:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(521786, 51211, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though the subject doesn''t "grab" my attention, the photo is very nicely done.  Very effective lighting.</td>', 'Though the subject doesn''t "grab" my attention, the photo is very nicely done.  Very effective lighting.', '2003-12-24 05:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(521788, 51571, 2553, '<td valign="top">A clean, uncluttered and simple shot, I find this to be very visually appealing.</td>', 'A clean, uncluttered and simple shot, I find this to be very visually appealing.', '2003-12-24 05:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(521790, 51710, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I don''t find this to be a very compelling subject (for me),  I love the warm colors and the intricate detail.  Lighting is great.</td>', 'Though I don''t find this to be a very compelling subject (for me),  I love the warm colors and the intricate detail.  Lighting is great.', '2003-12-24 05:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(521792, 51019, 2553, '<td valign="top">How on earth did you manage this??!! The colors in the shot work very well together, and the dof directs the eye immediately to the main focus of the shot.  I am anxious to see what kind of lens you shot this with.</td>', 'How on earth did you manage this??!! The colors in the shot work very well together, and the dof directs the eye immediately to the main focus of the shot.  I am anxious to see what kind of lens you shot this with.', '2003-12-24 05:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(521793, 51760, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Would have loved to see more light on the color areas to make the colors "pop".   Quite a lovely shot though.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Would have loved to see more light on the color areas to make the colors "pop".   Quite a lovely shot though.', '2003-12-24 05:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(521794, 50973, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice lighting.  The "busyness" of the leaves, flowers, or whatever, tends to draw my eye away from the frog, and detracts (for me) somewhat from the terrific capture of the frog itself.</td>', 'Cool shot, nice lighting.  The "busyness" of the leaves, flowers, or whatever, tends to draw my eye away from the frog, and detracts (for me) somewhat from the terrific capture of the frog itself.', '2003-12-24 05:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(521796, 51662, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very very cool shot. (No pun intended!)  Details, I want details!  Hope you have some in your photog comments section.  ! Would have been absolutely perfect with a third, or even part of a third, snowflake, making for a more dynamic composition.</td>', 'Very very cool shot. (No pun intended!)  Details, I want details!  Hope you have some in your photog comments section.  ! Would have been absolutely perfect with a third, or even part of a third, snowflake, making for a more dynamic composition.', '2003-12-24 05:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(521798, 51370, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting; crisp and clear shot with good composition. The contrast in the coloring between the face and the fabric feels "odd" to me.</td>', 'Nice lighting; crisp and clear shot with good composition. The contrast in the coloring between the face and the fabric feels "odd" to me.', '2003-12-24 05:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(521800, 51461, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; he composed himself beautifully for you.  Good lighting, and I am so glad you left it in color.</td>', 'Nice shot; he composed himself beautifully for you.  Good lighting, and I am so glad you left it in color.', '2003-12-24 05:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(521802, 51473, 2553, '<td valign="top">Back for another look, and to comment.  Basically, I am speechless.  An absolutely perfectly executed shot. Superb color, lighting and composition.  One of the most visually compelling shots I''ve ever seen at dpc.10</td>', 'Back for another look, and to comment.  Basically, I am speechless.  An absolutely perfectly executed shot. Superb color, lighting and composition.  One of the most visually compelling shots I''ve ever seen at dpc.10', '2003-12-24 05:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521803, 51752, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great capture, terrific lighting, good composition, and amazing color.</td>', 'Great capture, terrific lighting, good composition, and amazing color.', '2003-12-24 05:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(521804, 51799, 2553, '<td valign="top">As much as I hate to say this; this is definitely a case where I wish every single pixel was in perfect focus because I really want to see every bit of detail in this amazing flower.  Gorgeous colors, and an effective composition.  Not crazy about the fairly wide, white border.</td>', 'As much as I hate to say this; this is definitely a case where I wish every single pixel was in perfect focus because I really want to see every bit of detail in this amazing flower.  Gorgeous colors, and an effective composition.  Not crazy about the fairly wide, white border.', '2003-12-24 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(521805, 51800, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though subjectively not "high impact" for me, this has interesting lighting and composition, and the repetitive pattern of the bright red "lacing" gives it some visual impact.</td>', 'Though subjectively not "high impact" for me, this has interesting lighting and composition, and the repetitive pattern of the bright red "lacing" gives it some visual impact.', '2003-12-24 05:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(521808, 51791, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice warm colors.  Composition (for me) is quite static - very centered; straight up and down, and not terribly visually engaging.  Would have much preferred to see the guitar photographed at some kind of an angle in the composition to create more visual "interest".</td>', 'Good lighting and nice warm colors.  Composition (for me) is quite static - very centered; straight up and down, and not terribly visually engaging.  Would have much preferred to see the guitar photographed at some kind of an angle in the composition to create more visual "interest".', '2003-12-24 05:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(521811, 51740, 2553, '<td valign="top">Back for another look, and to comment.  A great capture on the sparks.  Interesting and visually engaging. 8</td>', 'Back for another look, and to comment.  A great capture on the sparks.  Interesting and visually engaging. 8', '2003-12-24 05:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521813, 51108, 2553, '<td valign="top">This has kind of a "wallpaper" feel to it, not something that I generally like, but this has such crisp clarity and beautiful color to it.  Very nice lighting, but a somewhat static composition.</td>', 'This has kind of a "wallpaper" feel to it, not something that I generally like, but this has such crisp clarity and beautiful color to it.  Very nice lighting, but a somewhat static composition.', '2003-12-24 05:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(521814, 51794, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  Great dof, and lovely color.  The definition in the bur is amazing.</td>', 'Very, very nice.  Great dof, and lovely color.  The definition in the bur is amazing.', '2003-12-24 05:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(521816, 51721, 2553, '<td valign="top">Incredible!  I''m kind of sorry that I have seen a fly up this close, but this shot is amazing.  Great lighting.</td>', 'Incredible!  I''m kind of sorry that I have seen a fly up this close, but this shot is amazing.  Great lighting.', '2003-12-24 05:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(521818, 51771, 2553, '<td valign="top">Subjectively not a compelling photo for me.  Nice lighting; would like to have seen a little more of a dynamic composition.</td>', 'Subjectively not a compelling photo for me.  Nice lighting; would like to have seen a little more of a dynamic composition.', '2003-12-24 05:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(521820, 51781, 2553, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept.  I would like to have seen more light on your subject to really make it "pop" out from the background.  It''s a bit dark, and tonally, almost blends into the background.  Would also like to see a more dynamic composition- perhaps at a bit more of an angle.</td>', 'An interesting concept.  I would like to have seen more light on your subject to really make it "pop" out from the background.  It''s a bit dark, and tonally, almost blends into the background.  Would also like to see a more dynamic composition- perhaps at a bit more of an angle.', '2003-12-24 05:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(521822, 51209, 2553, '<td valign="top">This looks like an advertising shot; for the case though, not the lipstick.  I actually think it''s pretty nicely done, with interesting lighting and composition, lovely color, and a border that doesn''t distract or detract from the shot.</td>', 'This looks like an advertising shot; for the case though, not the lipstick.  I actually think it''s pretty nicely done, with interesting lighting and composition, lovely color, and a border that doesn''t distract or detract from the shot.', '2003-12-24 05:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(521823, 51806, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty, with nice repetitive patterns that create visual interest.  Though this isn''t a "high impact" shot for me, it is appealing.</td>', 'Pretty, with nice repetitive patterns that create visual interest.  Though this isn''t a "high impact" shot for me, it is appealing.', '2003-12-24 05:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(521824, 51334, 2553, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea what phyto-fractals are, but they are fairly amazing!  Very interesting lighting, with warm tones on one side, and cool tones on the other.  Lots of visually engaging patterns, repetition, and texture, but in a way that is not busy or overwhelming.  Composition works beautifully to draw the eye throughout the photo.  Home page for sure.  10</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea what phyto-fractals are, but they are fairly amazing!  Very interesting lighting, with warm tones on one side, and cool tones on the other.  Lots of visually engaging patterns, repetition, and texture, but in a way that is not busy or overwhelming.  Composition works beautifully to draw the eye throughout the photo.  Home page for sure.  10', '2003-12-24 05:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(521829, 51701, 2553, '<td valign="top">Ahh.  Perfect. 10</td>', 'Ahh.  Perfect. 10', '2003-12-24 06:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(521832, 51685, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looked to me like a flower in the thumbnail!  Appealing color, composition and lighting.  Imaginative concept.</td>', 'Looked to me like a flower in the thumbnail!  Appealing color, composition and lighting.  Imaginative concept.', '2003-12-24 06:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(521835, 51350, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot for a reptile magazine.  Nice lighting and terrific composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like a shot for a reptile magazine.  Nice lighting and terrific composition.  Nicely done.', '2003-12-24 06:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(521839, 51766, 2553, '<td valign="top">A lovely and interesting shot with a very nice "art" feel to it that appeals to me.  Excellent composition.</td>', 'A lovely and interesting shot with a very nice "art" feel to it that appeals to me.  Excellent composition.', '2003-12-24 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(521896, 51800, 14614, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, really caught my eye</td>', 'Interesting composition, really caught my eye', '2003-12-24 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521930, 51689, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like the color here.</td>', 'I like the color here.', '2003-12-24 07:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(521935, 51629, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very colourful clean photo.9</td>', 'Very colourful clean photo.9', '2003-12-24 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(521936, 51719, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 9</td>', 'Very nice. 9', '2003-12-24 08:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(521964, 51732, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like the patterns created here, and the colors, but am missing a focal point. Maybe include a pencil ?</td>', 'I really like the patterns created here, and the colors, but am missing a focal point. Maybe include a pencil ?', '2003-12-24 08:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(521966, 51334, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pattern. Structure highlighted well through use of shadows. Could use a bit more depth in front.</td>', 'Wonderful pattern. Structure highlighted well through use of shadows. Could use a bit more depth in front.', '2003-12-24 08:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521967, 51498, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love the soft backlight and the center colors. Maybe crop a bit closer ?</td>', 'Love the soft backlight and the center colors. Maybe crop a bit closer ?', '2003-12-24 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(521968, 51740, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good image, I like it. A slightly closer crop, removing the blue from the top left, would have made it even better.</td>', 'Good image, I like it. A slightly closer crop, removing the blue from the top left, would have made it even better.', '2003-12-24 08:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521971, 51631, 4008, '<td valign="top">funny, but unsharp.</td>', 'funny, but unsharp.', '2003-12-24 08:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(521972, 51656, 4008, '<td valign="top">Why not rotate it 90 degrees ?</td>', 'Why not rotate it 90 degrees ?', '2003-12-24 08:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(521974, 51787, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think too much flash</td>', 'I think too much flash', '2003-12-24 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(521975, 51800, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great detail, great colors,  perfect composition. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great detail, great colors,  perfect composition. I like it a lot.', '2003-12-24 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(521981, 51683, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but for me it is not really working. The composition gets a bit messy, would be better if the whole face of the watch would be visible, too much going on.</td>', 'I like the idea, but for me it is not really working. The composition gets a bit messy, would be better if the whole face of the watch would be visible, too much going on.', '2003-12-24 09:05:50.000000', NULL, 1);
