(523234, 51740, 11977, '<td valign="top">I really love how you captured the sparks.  This makes a great abstract.  One tiny nit... I would have cropped or cloned the small area at the top left corner.</td>', 'I really love how you captured the sparks.  This makes a great abstract.  One tiny nit... I would have cropped or cloned the small area at the top left corner.', '2003-12-26 09:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523235, 51710, 11977, '<td valign="top">Nice... I especially like the variations of gold color.</td>', 'Nice... I especially like the variations of gold color.', '2003-12-26 09:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(523236, 51685, 11977, '<td valign="top">Great colors... this makes a beautiful abstract.</td>', 'Great colors... this makes a beautiful abstract.', '2003-12-26 09:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523237, 51777, 11977, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of motion here... love the comp and the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice feeling of motion here... love the comp and the shallow DOF.', '2003-12-26 09:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(523240, 51557, 11895, '<td valign="top">would look better if the face of the snake was not in shadow</td>', 'would look better if the face of the snake was not in shadow', '2003-12-26 10:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523241, 51678, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s an apple!</td>', 'It''s an apple!', '2003-12-26 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(523244, 51465, 11895, '<td valign="top">could have cropped a little more off the top to emphasize the chain and it''s shadow more</td>', 'could have cropped a little more off the top to emphasize the chain and it''s shadow more', '2003-12-26 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(523254, 51575, 11895, '<td valign="top">just a wee tad grainy, otherwise excellent</td>', 'just a wee tad grainy, otherwise excellent', '2003-12-26 10:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(523260, 51387, 11895, '<td valign="top">I might have gone for a little tighter crop on the bottom and left, otherwise nearly perfect;  I really like that your background has some texture and color of it\''s own, not the ordinary plain solid color; best in show</td>', 'I might have gone for a little tighter crop on the bottom and left, otherwise nearly perfect;  I really like that your background has some texture and color of it\''s own, not the ordinary plain solid color; best in show', '2003-12-26 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(523263, 51582, 11895, '<td valign="top">begs for color</td>', 'begs for color', '2003-12-26 11:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(523264, 51580, 11895, '<td valign="top">lovely pic, moved up a point on second look</td>', 'lovely pic, moved up a point on second look', '2003-12-26 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(523267, 51368, 11895, '<td valign="top">would have rated higher with me in color</td>', 'would have rated higher with me in color', '2003-12-26 11:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(523268, 50991, 11895, '<td valign="top">would have rated higher with me in color</td>', 'would have rated higher with me in color', '2003-12-26 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(523269, 51624, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good macro, would have rated higher with me if in color</td>', 'very good macro, would have rated higher with me if in color', '2003-12-26 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523291, 51689, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice subject,bit too dark,7...</td>', 'Nice subject,bit too dark,7...', '2003-12-26 12:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(523292, 51658, 6405, '<td valign="top">Interesting,tighten crop would do better and focus on the bigest drop !,7....</td>', 'Interesting,tighten crop would do better and focus on the bigest drop !,7....', '2003-12-26 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523293, 51514, 6405, '<td valign="top">Well done,10...</td>', 'Well done,10...', '2003-12-26 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(523302, 51368, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would have had more appeal to me without the cobwebs....  Nice compostion, focus, choice of tones, but the webs ruin it for me.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would have had more appeal to me without the cobwebs....  Nice compostion, focus, choice of tones, but the webs ruin it for me.TC', '2003-12-26 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(523349, 51769, 10858, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... :-) I really wanna taste this. :-) Lighting may be a bit harsh on the upper cookie, but great omposition. :-) Promise you will write the recipe after the challenge. :-)</td>', 'Mmmm... :-) I really wanna taste this. :-) Lighting may be a bit harsh on the upper cookie, but great omposition. :-) Promise you will write the recipe after the challenge. :-)', '2003-12-26 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(523363, 51514, 4400, '<td valign="top">This is a good one! 10pt<br/></td>', 'This is a good one! 10pt', '2003-12-26 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(523366, 51752, 4400, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and focus, good photo 10 pt</td>', 'Nice colour and focus, good photo 10 pt', '2003-12-26 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(523413, 51719, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great photo.... i like the colors and the composition, nice detail too.</td>', 'Great photo.... i like the colors and the composition, nice detail too.', '2003-12-26 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(523479, 51720, 14614, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and great detail.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Wonderful composition and great detail.  Excellent shot!', '2003-12-26 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(523480, 51752, 14614, '<td valign="top">First, my confession - I am partial to flower shots against a black background.  That said, this is a great shot, nice framing, great colors, interesting angle.</td>', 'First, my confession - I am partial to flower shots against a black background.  That said, this is a great shot, nice framing, great colors, interesting angle.', '2003-12-26 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(523481, 51753, 14614, '<td valign="top">Such a nice vingette.  The used ball adds character -  too bad the glove is soooo new ;)  I really like the composition.</td>', 'Such a nice vingette.  The used ball adds character -  too bad the glove is soooo new ;)  I really like the composition.', '2003-12-26 18:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(523486, 51702, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and the eye-dea (sorry!) but the edges and pixels absolutely had to be square to each other to deliver the message of perfection necessary for this concept. The slight skew of the image is therefore the reason I''ve marked this down to an [8]</td>', 'I like the focus and the eye-dea (sorry!) but the edges and pixels absolutely had to be square to each other to deliver the message of perfection necessary for this concept. The slight skew of the image is therefore the reason I''ve marked this down to an [8]', '2003-12-26 19:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523501, 51737, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject and very well lit. Texture is clear and detailed.<br/> <br/>I do feel that this could have been more impressive if you had cropped out the outer edges of the shell. Try masking the area with your hands - it looks instantly dynamic and impactful. Good job though.</td>', 'Beautiful subject and very well lit. Texture is clear and detailed. I do feel that this could have been more impressive if you had cropped out the outer edges of the shell. Try masking the area with your hands - it looks instantly dynamic and impactful. Good job though.', '2003-12-26 19:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(523504, 51678, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favourite brand of computer. <br/> <br/>A great viewpoint with excellent detail and focus. Could be a ribbon for you here.</td>', 'I think this is my favourite brand of computer.  A great viewpoint with excellent detail and focus. Could be a ribbon for you here.', '2003-12-26 19:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523506, 51662, 8860, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win blue I''ll eat my legs.<br/> <br/>The subject is stunning, beautiful lighting and crystal clear focus (pun intended). I can''t imagine anyone voting less than 10 really - apart from being a bit pedantic about your cropping. Personally I just love to see these wonderful things in such detail.  [10]</td>', 'If this doesn''t win blue I''ll eat my legs. The subject is stunning, beautiful lighting and crystal clear focus (pun intended). I can''t imagine anyone voting less than 10 really - apart from being a bit pedantic about your cropping. Personally I just love to see these wonderful things in such detail.  [10]', '2003-12-26 19:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(523507, 51565, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot but marred only by some banding across the match head area. Border is too subtle and ineffective. Good composition and title.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot but marred only by some banding across the match head area. Border is too subtle and ineffective. Good composition and title.', '2003-12-26 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(523510, 51663, 8860, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot - very clear and crisp. The subject (although plentiful on this site) is still very unusual looking and is well lit with strong colour. Composition may have been better as portrait, filling the frame.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot - very clear and crisp. The subject (although plentiful on this site) is still very unusual looking and is well lit with strong colour. Composition may have been better as portrait, filling the frame.', '2003-12-26 20:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(523512, 51624, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great product shot - ad worthy stuff and would probably do nicely gracing the pages of Braun''s(?) advertising. Lovely lighting, tone, focus et al - just a touch over exposed at the top.<br/> <br/>Marked down slightly for off-centre focusing and cropping.</td>', 'Great product shot - ad worthy stuff and would probably do nicely gracing the pages of Braun''s(?) advertising. Lovely lighting, tone, focus et al - just a touch over exposed at the top. Marked down slightly for off-centre focusing and cropping.', '2003-12-26 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(523516, 51759, 8860, '<td valign="top">While crisply focused it is too far back from the watch face. This shot also suffers from harsh lighting and unaesthetic composition, since the space top left is not functional in any way to the shot.</td>', 'While crisply focused it is too far back from the watch face. This shot also suffers from harsh lighting and unaesthetic composition, since the space top left is not functional in any way to the shot.', '2003-12-26 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523633, 51565, 15422, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.</td>', 'Nice pic.', '2003-12-27 01:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(523645, 51554, 8816, '<td valign="top">Would''ve done very well in the tacky x-mas decoration category!</td>', 'Would''ve done very well in the tacky x-mas decoration category!', '2003-12-27 03:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(523698, 51727, 10705, '<td valign="top">nice detail ... I like the use of red thread ... adds interest!</td>', 'nice detail ... I like the use of red thread ... adds interest!', '2003-12-27 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(523704, 51800, 10887, '<td valign="top">This is pretty..</td>', 'This is pretty..', '2003-12-27 10:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(523707, 51648, 10705, '<td valign="top">Love the shadow!</td>', 'Love the shadow!', '2003-12-27 10:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(523717, 51744, 10705, '<td valign="top">terrific shot ... love the gold shadow!!</td>', 'terrific shot ... love the gold shadow!!', '2003-12-27 10:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(523722, 51701, 10705, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful ... dof, color, clarity ... very nice!!!</td>', 'absolutely beautiful ... dof, color, clarity ... very nice!!!', '2003-12-27 10:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(523724, 51631, 10705, '<td valign="top">very creative - nice use of color ... focus is a little soft, tho.</td>', 'very creative - nice use of color ... focus is a little soft, tho.', '2003-12-27 10:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523749, 51735, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract of shapes and colors. What are they?</td>', 'An interesting abstract of shapes and colors. What are they?', '2003-12-27 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(523751, 51691, 10887, '<td valign="top">A wonderful wonderful image and a real macro!</td>', 'A wonderful wonderful image and a real macro!', '2003-12-27 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(523752, 51541, 12393, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement on a clean background ,  wish the focus could be on all the jars .. or at least on the front ones .</td>', 'Nice arrangement on a clean background ,  wish the focus could be on all the jars .. or at least on the front ones .', '2003-12-27 11:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(523754, 51252, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendition. The water droplets add a lot; the hot spots detract a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful rendition. The water droplets add a lot; the hot spots detract a bit.', '2003-12-27 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(523756, 51822, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, but the subject doesn''t have enough inherent interest to carry the photo, and the depth of field falls off too much.</td>', 'Nice closeup, but the subject doesn''t have enough inherent interest to carry the photo, and the depth of field falls off too much.', '2003-12-27 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(523758, 51629, 12393, '<td valign="top">Good job ...my question for such shots is always is it a real butterfly/moth ? Also think the picture would be better if the butterfly was more in focus like the bud it is on.</td>', 'Good job ...my question for such shots is always is it a real butterfly/moth ? Also think the picture would be better if the butterfly was more in focus like the bud it is on.', '2003-12-27 11:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(523761, 51128, 12393, '<td valign="top">Good title and picture. My only thought was that the out of focus parts in the lower left and right distract from the clarity of the top ....maybe some cropping out of the lowe part of the picture could have helped improve it?</td>', 'Good title and picture. My only thought was that the out of focus parts in the lower left and right distract from the clarity of the top ....maybe some cropping out of the lowe part of the picture could have helped improve it?', '2003-12-27 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(523762, 51607, 12393, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of colours and placing in the frame.</td>', 'Nice combination of colours and placing in the frame.', '2003-12-27 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(523763, 51778, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is one of nature''s beautiful patterns, and you have captured it nicely. Excellent detail on the foreground and nice lighting to bring out the texture. IMHO it could be cropped at the left to remove some of the out-of-focus portions.</td>', 'This is one of nature''s beautiful patterns, and you have captured it nicely. Excellent detail on the foreground and nice lighting to bring out the texture. IMHO it could be cropped at the left to remove some of the out-of-focus portions.', '2003-12-27 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(523765, 51682, 12393, '<td valign="top">Good capture ,  one of the pics that grabbed my attention warranting a closer look ... I would suggest trying this out again but without the red lighting to see if that would make it look better ?</td>', 'Good capture ,  one of the pics that grabbed my attention warranting a closer look ... I would suggest trying this out again but without the red lighting to see if that would make it look better ?', '2003-12-27 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(523768, 50909, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shot. How do you get the cat to sit still for a closeup like this? Mine would never stand for it!</td>', 'Great shot. How do you get the cat to sit still for a closeup like this? Mine would never stand for it!', '2003-12-27 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(523770, 51148, 12393, '<td valign="top">The picture meets the challenge and has good clarity but I think there are too many items in the picture that are distracting ....just the leaf by itself would have been an awesome shot ...same with just the wing or the feather .... all put togehter they seem to fight for attention ...it could be just me with ADD ....and dont worry am giving you more than 5 ...</td>', 'The picture meets the challenge and has good clarity but I think there are too many items in the picture that are distracting ....just the leaf by itself would have been an awesome shot ...same with just the wing or the feather .... all put togehter they seem to fight for attention ...it could be just me with ADD ....and dont worry am giving you more than 5 ...', '2003-12-27 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(523772, 51161, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty ornament. I think it would be more effective if you came in even closer - or lacking that, cropped it tighter. Just the ball and the gold ribbon, without all the extra needles - and certainly without the dead black portions - would jump off the screen.</td>', 'This is a very pretty ornament. I think it would be more effective if you came in even closer - or lacking that, cropped it tighter. Just the ball and the gold ribbon, without all the extra needles - and certainly without the dead black portions - would jump off the screen.', '2003-12-27 11:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(523777, 51350, 12733, '<td valign="top">Ribbit to you too. Great shot - is this a live frog? I would not be surprised to find out it is a replica, but I''m not sure. Not that it would affect the rating.</td>', 'Ribbit to you too. Great shot - is this a live frog? I would not be surprised to find out it is a replica, but I''m not sure. Not that it would affect the rating.', '2003-12-27 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523778, 51729, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting and texture are superb. The effect is very mysterious and I find myself just staring at this thing trying to figure out what it is.</td>', 'The lighting and texture are superb. The effect is very mysterious and I find myself just staring at this thing trying to figure out what it is.', '2003-12-27 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(523779, 51766, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous high-key effect. The misty feeling fits the subject well.</td>', 'What a gorgeous high-key effect. The misty feeling fits the subject well.', '2003-12-27 11:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(523782, 51823, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and pretty color rendition.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and pretty color rendition.', '2003-12-27 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(523786, 51781, 12733, '<td valign="top">This shot does what a macro does best - brings out detail you would never notice at the usual angle and distance of view. Very nice.</td>', 'This shot does what a macro does best - brings out detail you would never notice at the usual angle and distance of view. Very nice.', '2003-12-27 11:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(523787, 51710, 12393, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition , meets the macro challenge but I think you may be able to get a better response to razor sharp clarity of the image ....the soft focus is intentional for this but is distracting ....</td>', 'A very interesting composition , meets the macro challenge but I think you may be able to get a better response to razor sharp clarity of the image ....the soft focus is intentional for this but is distracting ....', '2003-12-27 11:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(523791, 51701, 12393, '<td valign="top">Very good, one of my personal favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'Very good, one of my personal favourites for this challenge.', '2003-12-27 11:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(523792, 51727, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the metallic sheen and the texture of the thread. This macro view brings out details you would never notice in years of sewing.</td>', 'Great capture of the metallic sheen and the texture of the thread. This macro view brings out details you would never notice in years of sewing.', '2003-12-27 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(523795, 51771, 12733, '<td valign="top">A good macro photo can make you look at familiar objects in a new way, and you have done that very well. The wood grain texture, the shiny gold - who would have thunk there was so much visual interest in a common pencil.</td>', 'A good macro photo can make you look at familiar objects in a new way, and you have done that very well. The wood grain texture, the shiny gold - who would have thunk there was so much visual interest in a common pencil.', '2003-12-27 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(523798, 51687, 12733, '<td valign="top">To me, one of the most attractive features on a pencil is the joint of painted wood and shaved wood to make the point. Backing off just a little bit would have brought out that contrast of materials and added a lot to your picture, even if it was a bit less macro.</td>', 'To me, one of the most attractive features on a pencil is the joint of painted wood and shaved wood to make the point. Backing off just a little bit would have brought out that contrast of materials and added a lot to your picture, even if it was a bit less macro.', '2003-12-27 11:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(523799, 51299, 10887, '<td valign="top">Great macro and a very good idea!</td>', 'Great macro and a very good idea!', '2003-12-27 11:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(523806, 51819, 11793, '<td valign="top">a bit harsher light, and maybe a different angle would bring out more detail in the textures i think.<br/> <br/>interesting</td>', 'a bit harsher light, and maybe a different angle would bring out more detail in the textures i think. interesting', '2003-12-27 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(523808, 51721, 14001, '<td valign="top">This is my choice for the winner.  Great lighting.  Excellent DOF.  Awesome detali.  If that background could have stayed light all the way through the top, I''d give it a 10.  But, as is 9.  Thanks.</td>', 'This is my choice for the winner.  Great lighting.  Excellent DOF.  Awesome detali.  If that background could have stayed light all the way through the top, I''d give it a 10.  But, as is 9.  Thanks.', '2003-12-27 11:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(523810, 51740, 14001, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very good.  Background is excellent.  I wish I didn''t see whatever that is on the bottom of picture next to the wheel.  9.</td>', 'Lighting is very good.  Background is excellent.  I wish I didn''t see whatever that is on the bottom of picture next to the wheel.  9.', '2003-12-27 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(523811, 51770, 14001, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The bluish area on top is my only criticism.  Like the light levels, don''t let anyone tell you it''s too dark.  8.</td>', 'Very creative.  The bluish area on top is my only criticism.  Like the light levels, don''t let anyone tell you it''s too dark.  8.', '2003-12-27 11:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(523812, 51794, 14001, '<td valign="top">Awesome DOF.  Best in Challenge.  Great detail.  Give it an 8 just because other pics (2) are more interesting and have same attention to detail.  Thanks.  8.</td>', 'Awesome DOF.  Best in Challenge.  Great detail.  Give it an 8 just because other pics (2) are more interesting and have same attention to detail.  Thanks.  8.', '2003-12-27 11:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(523814, 51719, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice Jelly''s.  Too much happening though.  Better if you only had one in the frame.  Taken in Monterey?  8.</td>', 'Nice Jelly''s.  Too much happening though.  Better if you only had one in the frame.  Taken in Monterey?  8.', '2003-12-27 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(523815, 51727, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I really like it when someone can make something as boring as a sewing machine interesting to look at.  Red thread did it for me.  Background to right is distracting. 8.</td>', 'Nice work.  I really like it when someone can make something as boring as a sewing machine interesting to look at.  Red thread did it for me.  Background to right is distracting. 8.', '2003-12-27 12:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(523817, 51643, 14001, '<td valign="top">Awesome eyes.  I can see you in his right eye though, and to me that''s a serious downgrade.  Still best cat shot.   8.</td>', 'Awesome eyes.  I can see you in his right eye though, and to me that''s a serious downgrade.  Still best cat shot.   8.', '2003-12-27 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(523819, 51721, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice macro - somewhat artificial placement of fly for this viewer</td>', 'nice macro - somewhat artificial placement of fly for this viewer', '2003-12-27 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(523820, 51580, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  A bit too dark though.  Nice comp.  8.</td>', 'Nice colors.  A bit too dark though.  Nice comp.  8.', '2003-12-27 12:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(523821, 51334, 6624, '<td valign="top">very interesting shapes, light and shadow, colors have a ood range, an interesting composition</td>', 'very interesting shapes, light and shadow, colors have a ood range, an interesting composition', '2003-12-27 12:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(523822, 51744, 6624, '<td valign="top">the shadows are very nice and give a good compositional feel..a small crop on handle to get rid of flash...?</td>', 'the shadows are very nice and give a good compositional feel..a small crop on handle to get rid of flash...?', '2003-12-27 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(523824, 51791, 6624, '<td valign="top">this has a slightly warped feel for me and it is a distraction from the nice warmth and the textures</td>', 'this has a slightly warped feel for me and it is a distraction from the nice warmth and the textures', '2003-12-27 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(523826, 51370, 14001, '<td valign="top">Most creative shot in challenge.  Really nice.  Don''t get the title at all.  Is this a play on all the bug shots that are usually in macro photography?  If so, not nearly as creative as the pic.  Almost makes it look like you were lucky with the pic cause your title is really bad, sorry.  8.</td>', 'Most creative shot in challenge.  Really nice.  Don''t get the title at all.  Is this a play on all the bug shots that are usually in macro photography?  If so, not nearly as creative as the pic.  Almost makes it look like you were lucky with the pic cause your title is really bad, sorry.  8.', '2003-12-27 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(523828, 51701, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice composition (jasmine?)  and nice use of buds...the soft focus on the blossom at the back is fine but I find the focus or lack of it on the stem distracting</td>', 'nice composition (jasmine?)  and nice use of buds...the soft focus on the blossom at the back is fine but I find the focus or lack of it on the stem distracting', '2003-12-27 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(523830, 51557, 6624, '<td valign="top">the lighting is problematic but the idea andf the composition, espoecially catching the tongue,  is very nice</td>', 'the lighting is problematic but the idea andf the composition, espoecially catching the tongue,  is very nice', '2003-12-27 12:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(523831, 51806, 6624, '<td valign="top">very pretty ice crystals, nice composition anfd clarity</td>', 'very pretty ice crystals, nice composition anfd clarity', '2003-12-27 12:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(523832, 51649, 6624, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful shot to go back and hang in the hot summer...very lovely use of the green in the surrounding space</td>', 'what a wonderful shot to go back and hang in the hot summer...very lovely use of the green in the surrounding space', '2003-12-27 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
