(523995, 51142, 10402, '<td valign="top">Red symbolizes heat and excitement, the opposite of the icicles. Nice juxtaposition.</td>', 'Red symbolizes heat and excitement, the opposite of the icicles. Nice juxtaposition.', '2003-12-27 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(523999, 51753, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and coloration. The multiple shadows are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition and coloration. The multiple shadows are a bit distracting.', '2003-12-27 18:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(524002, 51295, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting background; one more strand behind his hat would help show its shape. The subject is a bit blurry and there are a fringes around the black lines.</td>', 'Interesting background; one more strand behind his hat would help show its shape. The subject is a bit blurry and there are a fringes around the black lines.', '2003-12-27 18:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(524005, 51720, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. We so often focus on the holiday flower we don''t notice the interesting patterns and textures in the leaves. Good composition here; the diagonal lines add excitement. The lighting shows off the texture; a little sharpening would bring it out even more.</td>', 'Nice shot. We so often focus on the holiday flower we don''t notice the interesting patterns and textures in the leaves. Good composition here; the diagonal lines add excitement. The lighting shows off the texture; a little sharpening would bring it out even more.', '2003-12-27 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(524006, 51513, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice highlighting on the delicate hairs.</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice highlighting on the delicate hairs.', '2003-12-27 19:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(524008, 51343, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting color. The lighting shows off the embossed shapes, but there are so many specular highlights that they are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting color. The lighting shows off the embossed shapes, but there are so many specular highlights that they are distracting.', '2003-12-27 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(524009, 51438, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  I think some natural light would have made this even better.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  I think some natural light would have made this even better.', '2003-12-27 19:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(524011, 51719, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup capture through glass!</td>', 'Excellent closeup capture through glass!', '2003-12-27 19:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(524012, 51643, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup.  Very good overall.  While I am not crazy over overly sharp images, I''ve ve seen cat eyes even sharper, and I think a little more sharpness here would have given it a wow factor.  Still, I know pet photos are difificult, and this is very very good!</td>', 'Excellent closeup.  Very good overall.  While I am not crazy over overly sharp images, I''ve ve seen cat eyes even sharper, and I think a little more sharpness here would have given it a wow factor.  Still, I know pet photos are difificult, and this is very very good!', '2003-12-27 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(524014, 51575, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like this overall and the use of the reflection.  I think if you could have shot a relection of something with 1''s and 0''s though, it might have been even cooler.  BTW - I think you have bad sector on the left hand side ;)</td>', 'I like this overall and the use of the reflection.  I think if you could have shot a relection of something with 1''s and 0''s though, it might have been even cooler.  BTW - I think you have bad sector on the left hand side ;)', '2003-12-27 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(524021, 51644, 10402, '<td valign="top">The wilted flower on the vast hostile background with yellow coloration conveys a clear message of betrayal, loneliness and dispair. Not a message I like very well, so the image is disturbing to me. But the fact that it elicits such a strong reaction means that the photo is well done.</td>', 'The wilted flower on the vast hostile background with yellow coloration conveys a clear message of betrayal, loneliness and dispair. Not a message I like very well, so the image is disturbing to me. But the fact that it elicits such a strong reaction means that the photo is well done.', '2003-12-27 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(524023, 51721, 7304, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and clarity. Don''t like flies but this is great. 9</td>', 'Excellent exposure and clarity. Don''t like flies but this is great. 9', '2003-12-27 19:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(524024, 51720, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the detail. 7</td>', 'Love the colors and the detail. 7', '2003-12-27 19:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
