(524045, 51828, 8860, '<td valign="top">Some nice detail and well lit. I''m not keen on the magenta/blue hue on the edge of the blade but it''s a dynamic composition.</td>', 'Some nice detail and well lit. I''m not keen on the magenta/blue hue on the edge of the blade but it''s a dynamic composition.', '2003-12-27 19:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(524047, 51689, 8860, '<td valign="top">Extremely cute concept! Top marks for that - although it seems a little ironic that many of the little ''mouths'' are downturned and looking a tad miserable!  ;)<br/> <br/>Excellent detail and rich colour too - very festive.</td>', 'Extremely cute concept! Top marks for that - although it seems a little ironic that many of the little ''mouths'' are downturned and looking a tad miserable!  ;) Excellent detail and rich colour too - very festive.', '2003-12-27 19:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(524049, 51367, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour and detail although cropping could have been tighter to maximise focus.</td>', 'Lovely colour and detail although cropping could have been tighter to maximise focus.', '2003-12-27 19:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(524053, 51462, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say that this doesn''t interest me at all. It has much to do with a lack of focus but also to do with a rather plain subject shot in an unengaging way. <br/> <br/>For this to work I think you really need to get a lot closer to obscure some context since there is much in your shot that is unnecessary. The earring may look more unusual and generate more intrigue if it was shot from any other angle than the one that we would normally view it from, for instance from under the ear looking up or over the ear looking down onto a naked shoulder, creating a sensual vibe and some visual confusion.<br/> <br/>Ultimately your duotone effect and lens flare seem like substitutes for a good compsition.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say that this doesn''t interest me at all. It has much to do with a lack of focus but also to do with a rather plain subject shot in an unengaging way.  For this to work I think you really need to get a lot closer to obscure some context since there is much in your shot that is unnecessary. The earring may look more unusual and generate more intrigue if it was shot from any other angle than the one that we would normally view it from, for instance from under the ear looking up or over the ear looking down onto a naked shoulder, creating a sensual vibe and some visual confusion. Ultimately your duotone effect and lens flare seem like substitutes for a good compsition.', '2003-12-27 19:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(524054, 51571, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but just too out of focus. Good lighting and exposure.</td>', 'Nice idea but just too out of focus. Good lighting and exposure.', '2003-12-27 19:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
