(524074, 51350, 8860, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus, good lightig and lovely texture make this very satisfying to behold. the frog could have been facing the camera more though, but it''s well composed. Nice one - and I love Whites Treefrogs!</td>', 'Crisp focus, good lightig and lovely texture make this very satisfying to behold. the frog could have been facing the camera more though, but it''s well composed. Nice one - and I love Whites Treefrogs!', '2003-12-27 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
