(524103, 51766, 7485, '<td valign="top">High-key is tricky (at least I''ve never gotten it right!), and here I think the problem is that the center looks like it has lots of shadows, only they are over-exposed. A good high-key shot can have dark shadows, only they can''t cover significant portions of the image. Anyway, great composition, and I rather like the frame.</td>', 'High-key is tricky (at least I''ve never gotten it right!), and here I think the problem is that the center looks like it has lots of shadows, only they are over-exposed. A good high-key shot can have dark shadows, only they can''t cover significant portions of the image. Anyway, great composition, and I rather like the frame.', '2003-12-27 20:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(524106, 51782, 14012, '<td valign="top">a little hot on the left side, but looks good for the most part</td>', 'a little hot on the left side, but looks good for the most part', '2003-12-27 20:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
