(524145, 51787, 14012, '<td valign="top">not a bad shot, there is just a bit of noise though. I was working on a shot like this, but just couldn''t get that crisp focus. You''ve almost got it.</td>', 'not a bad shot, there is just a bit of noise though. I was working on a shot like this, but just couldn''t get that crisp focus. You''ve almost got it.', '2003-12-27 21:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
