(524151, 51334, 7969, '<td valign="top">Fabulous and interesting shot, great unique subject! Composition and colors are nice too.</td>', 'Fabulous and interesting shot, great unique subject! Composition and colors are nice too.', '2003-12-27 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(524152, 51465, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the uniqueness, lighting and composition of your shot.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the uniqueness, lighting and composition of your shot.  Well done!', '2003-12-27 21:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(524153, 51758, 14012, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone is great here.</td>', 'The sepia tone is great here.', '2003-12-27 21:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(524154, 51350, 7969, '<td valign="top">Now this dude''s got character, and great lighting, I do wish we could see his face a bit more, good use of DOF.  Well done.</td>', 'Now this dude''s got character, and great lighting, I do wish we could see his face a bit more, good use of DOF.  Well done.', '2003-12-27 21:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(524155, 51794, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the unique subject of your photo, the clarity of the ''curl'' at ends as well as the dew drops.  Is that a moth too?  Well Done!</td>', 'I like the unique subject of your photo, the clarity of the ''curl'' at ends as well as the dew drops.  Is that a moth too?  Well Done!', '2003-12-27 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(524156, 51366, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this alot- but the shadow is distracting.</td>', 'I like this alot- but the shadow is distracting.', '2003-12-27 21:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(524157, 51481, 12611, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the glare or the blueish tint to the whole thing. I do think the composition is quite good though.</td>', 'I don''t like the glare or the blueish tint to the whole thing. I do think the composition is quite good though.', '2003-12-27 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(524158, 51338, 12611, '<td valign="top">Almost a Pollock composition- he would have used mosre contrast whiter whites instead of cream- and deeper blacks behind the whites. What is also strange is that unlike in painting, there are focal spots in your photo- blurry and sharp. I really like your composition and more people should do shots like this.</td>', 'Almost a Pollock composition- he would have used mosre contrast whiter whites instead of cream- and deeper blacks behind the whites. What is also strange is that unlike in painting, there are focal spots in your photo- blurry and sharp. I really like your composition and more people should do shots like this.', '2003-12-27 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(524159, 51181, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Great colors - black, lime green and white go great together. way to go/</td>', 'Nice title. Great colors - black, lime green and white go great together. way to go/', '2003-12-27 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(524160, 51209, 12611, '<td valign="top">I suspect you over sharpened the hell out of this. and I should say it works. Very sensual and phallic photo, despite the obvious feminine subject. great shot.</td>', 'I suspect you over sharpened the hell out of this. and I should say it works. Very sensual and phallic photo, despite the obvious feminine subject. great shot.', '2003-12-27 22:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(524161, 51818, 12611, '<td valign="top">I know th ecolor scheme is not french- but it seems french or european here. the tones of the silver are a bit disturbing.</td>', 'I know th ecolor scheme is not french- but it seems french or european here. the tones of the silver are a bit disturbing.', '2003-12-27 22:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(524162, 51211, 12611, '<td valign="top">As a guitar player, I  like this shot. I love the cut strings- just seeing them that close reminds me ou the sting of a puncture wound.</td>', 'As a guitar player, I  like this shot. I love the cut strings- just seeing them that close reminds me ou the sting of a puncture wound.', '2003-12-27 22:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(524172, 51729, 11078, '<td valign="top">Scary<br/>I will move you up another point now I know what it is I thought it was a mask<br/>But yes it is very clever.</td>', 'ScaryI will move you up another point now I know what it is I thought it was a maskBut yes it is very clever.', '2003-12-27 22:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(524193, 51498, 10402, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Beautiful subject nicely captured. Great detail in the middle with nicely soft petals.</td>', 'Stunning. Beautiful subject nicely captured. Great detail in the middle with nicely soft petals.', '2003-12-27 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(524194, 51648, 10402, '<td valign="top">The shadow is as interesting as the bulb. I like the background and the composition; the negative space works well.</td>', 'The shadow is as interesting as the bulb. I like the background and the composition; the negative space works well.', '2003-12-27 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(524196, 51519, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good choice of elements. Need a little more space around the cone. Some sharpening would help too.</td>', 'Good choice of elements. Need a little more space around the cone. Some sharpening would help too.', '2003-12-27 23:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(524197, 51370, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrasts between the face and cloth.</td>', 'Interesting contrasts between the face and cloth.', '2003-12-27 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(524201, 51148, 10402, '<td valign="top">The elements go well together and are nicely arranged. Perfect lighting and exposure.</td>', 'The elements go well together and are nicely arranged. Perfect lighting and exposure.', '2003-12-27 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(524203, 51722, 10402, '<td valign="top">Using a penny for size comparison works well. The reflections add a nice touch.</td>', 'Using a penny for size comparison works well. The reflections add a nice touch.', '2003-12-27 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(524204, 51338, 10402, '<td valign="top">The arrangement is too random; there isn''t anything to catch the viewer''s interest.</td>', 'The arrangement is too random; there isn''t anything to catch the viewer''s interest.', '2003-12-27 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(524205, 51735, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting overall texture, but not a very exciting image.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting overall texture, but not a very exciting image.', '2003-12-27 23:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(524207, 51462, 15449, '<td valign="top">boring</td>', 'boring', '2003-12-28 00:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(524212, 51169, 12160, '<td valign="top">Creative and original, nice idea.</td>', 'Creative and original, nice idea.', '2003-12-28 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(524216, 51350, 15450, '<td valign="top">I love this pic, the lighting is awesome, and the frog looks like a green Jabba the Hutt!</td>', 'I love this pic, the lighting is awesome, and the frog looks like a green Jabba the Hutt!', '2003-12-28 01:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(524226, 51770, 15452, '<td valign="top">A very sweet and delicate photo!  I would love to call this one my own!  Nice DOF and sharpness... good natural lighting!  Nice!</td>', 'A very sweet and delicate photo!  I would love to call this one my own!  Nice DOF and sharpness... good natural lighting!  Nice!', '2003-12-28 04:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(524267, 51721, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is one of the best macro shots I have ever seen. Fantastic detail, down to the hairy fly. Spectaculary sharp &amp; in focus. Great contrast to highlight the furry bug. 10. Predicting a winner here!</td>', 'this is one of the best macro shots I have ever seen. Fantastic detail, down to the hairy fly. Spectaculary sharp & in focus. Great contrast to highlight the furry bug. 10. Predicting a winner here!', '2003-12-28 04:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(524268, 51662, 12268, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the BG. Would love to know how this was done.</td>', 'great shot, love the BG. Would love to know how this was done.', '2003-12-28 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(524270, 51706, 12268, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this is a traditional macro shot but who cares! Wonderful subject, love the complimentary light to go with the subject''s mysteriousness. 9</td>', 'Not sure that this is a traditional macro shot but who cares! Wonderful subject, love the complimentary light to go with the subject''s mysteriousness. 9', '2003-12-28 04:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(524271, 51350, 12268, '<td valign="top">very cool. love the lighting, the angle &amp; the composition. 9</td>', 'very cool. love the lighting, the angle & the composition. 9', '2003-12-28 04:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
