(524681, 51689, 7907, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!  some of the buds look like little mouths.  Awesome!</td>', 'This is stunning!  some of the buds look like little mouths.  Awesome!', '2003-12-28 20:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(524682, 51799, 14012, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. nice sharp focus, as well</td>', 'Love the colors. nice sharp focus, as well', '2003-12-28 20:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(524683, 51790, 14012, '<td valign="top">excellent crisp capture</td>', 'excellent crisp capture', '2003-12-28 20:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(524686, 51286, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the variety of metallic textures in this shot, from the shiny corners fo the nut to the rusted surfaces on top. The DOF is great, with the whole nut in focus, and then the rapid falloff. It emphasizes the main subject well.</td>', 'I like the variety of metallic textures in this shot, from the shiny corners fo the nut to the rusted surfaces on top. The DOF is great, with the whole nut in focus, and then the rapid falloff. It emphasizes the main subject well.', '2003-12-28 20:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(524694, 51820, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and brightness, but the hot spot outlined in green at the bottom detracts from the overall impression. This subject may be an exception to the rule of thirds - I think it would work better centered all around.</td>', 'Nice colors and brightness, but the hot spot outlined in green at the bottom detracts from the overall impression. This subject may be an exception to the rule of thirds - I think it would work better centered all around.', '2003-12-28 20:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(524696, 51779, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the metallic luster and the effect of the colors. The penny centrainly makes it clear that this is a really close up shot.</td>', 'I like the metallic luster and the effect of the colors. The penny centrainly makes it clear that this is a really close up shot.', '2003-12-28 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(524702, 51508, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between textures of the shell and the sand, and a nice rendition of the colors of the shell. The lighting emphasizes the shape of the shell well. I''m kind of back and forth as to whether better DOF and overall focus would improve the shot or detract from it.</td>', 'Nice contrast between textures of the shell and the sand, and a nice rendition of the colors of the shell. The lighting emphasizes the shape of the shell well. I''m kind of back and forth as to whether better DOF and overall focus would improve the shot or detract from it.', '2003-12-28 21:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(524705, 51649, 12733, '<td valign="top">The water droplets on the one hand add some drama to this shot, but at the same time there''s something slightly fake-looking about them, as if they are not really on the apple.</td>', 'The water droplets on the one hand add some drama to this shot, but at the same time there''s something slightly fake-looking about them, as if they are not really on the apple.', '2003-12-28 21:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(524708, 51465, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the textures of metal and snow - you really captured the crystalline structure of the snow and avoided the common problem of having it go all white. I think the composition would be more dynamic if the chain were placed diagonally across the picture; this is kind of static.</td>', 'I like the textures of metal and snow - you really captured the crystalline structure of the snow and avoided the common problem of having it go all white. I think the composition would be more dynamic if the chain were placed diagonally across the picture; this is kind of static.', '2003-12-28 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(524711, 51567, 12733, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the dog''s eye is interesting, but it seems there should be some detail of the white of his eye and the structure of the iris. You certainly got a macro view, but it might actually have worked better if you''d backd off just a bit.</td>', 'The reflection in the dog''s eye is interesting, but it seems there should be some detail of the white of his eye and the structure of the iris. You certainly got a macro view, but it might actually have worked better if you''d backd off just a bit.', '2003-12-28 21:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(524712, 51334, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what they are, but they make a lovely picture. Are these corals?</td>', 'I don''t know what they are, but they make a lovely picture. Are these corals?', '2003-12-28 21:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(524714, 51662, 12733, '<td valign="top">If these are real flakes, I''d love to hear how you captured them without melting and so perfectly squarely. If they aren''t real, you stil have a beautiful picture here.</td>', 'If these are real flakes, I''d love to hear how you captured them without melting and so perfectly squarely. If they aren''t real, you stil have a beautiful picture here.', '2003-12-28 21:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(524715, 51656, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice detail work on something we usually take for granted and see only as a point of light.</td>', 'Nice detail work on something we usually take for granted and see only as a point of light.', '2003-12-28 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(524717, 51473, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, the DOF and perfect lighting knock me out. Definitely a favorite photo in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, the DOF and perfect lighting knock me out. Definitely a favorite photo in this challenge.', '2003-12-28 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(524718, 51169, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great detail and texture. I hope they don''t jump you under the Patriot Act for burning material that refers to our leaders. It''s getting kind of hard to tell how much freedom of speech is still allowed since 9/11.</td>', 'Great detail and texture. I hope they don''t jump you under the Patriot Act for burning material that refers to our leaders. It''s getting kind of hard to tell how much freedom of speech is still allowed since 9/11.', '2003-12-28 21:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(524719, 51722, 12733, '<td valign="top">The trike is a beautiful small scupture, and I like the way you''ve lighted it and used a reflecting surface. Putting in the penny to show the scale was clever.</td>', 'The trike is a beautiful small scupture, and I like the way you''ve lighted it and used a reflecting surface. Putting in the penny to show the scale was clever.', '2003-12-28 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(524721, 51541, 12733, '<td valign="top">The idea of lining up the jars is great, and the overall mix of colors is effective, and the shapes make a nice composition. I think it might have been more effective to have your sharpest focus at the front, at least two jars in sharp focus, and then the falloff toward the back of the photo.</td>', 'The idea of lining up the jars is great, and the overall mix of colors is effective, and the shapes make a nice composition. I think it might have been more effective to have your sharpest focus at the front, at least two jars in sharp focus, and then the falloff toward the back of the photo.', '2003-12-28 21:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(524722, 51128, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if there''s any way to avoid it, but the out-of-focus spines at the front detract from what is otherwise a great picture.</td>', 'I don''t know if there''s any way to avoid it, but the out-of-focus spines at the front detract from what is otherwise a great picture.', '2003-12-28 21:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(524723, 51732, 12733, '<td valign="top">It took a minute to relate this abstraction with the title of the photo. This must have taken a great deal of work, but it is a beautiful mix of color and texture. It was impossible to just look at it, rate it and move on because there''s so much to see in it.</td>', 'It took a minute to relate this abstraction with the title of the photo. This must have taken a great deal of work, but it is a beautiful mix of color and texture. It was impossible to just look at it, rate it and move on because there''s so much to see in it.', '2003-12-28 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(524725, 51799, 12733, '<td valign="top">When you get this close up, familiar objects become abstracts. In this case, the colors, shapes and composition are spot on. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'When you get this close up, familiar objects become abstracts. In this case, the colors, shapes and composition are spot on. Beautiful shot.', '2003-12-28 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(524726, 51702, 12733, '<td valign="top">Black and white is the right medium for this photo, and the filter creates interesting textures - though the detail in a human eye is amazing when you get this close and the pattern somewhat obscures it.</td>', 'Black and white is the right medium for this photo, and the filter creates interesting textures - though the detail in a human eye is amazing when you get this close and the pattern somewhat obscures it.', '2003-12-28 21:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(524728, 51787, 12733, '<td valign="top">The perfect lens indeed, and you have caught the detail in it perfectly. Great lighting, focus and exposure.</td>', 'The perfect lens indeed, and you have caught the detail in it perfectly. Great lighting, focus and exposure.', '2003-12-28 21:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(524734, 51656, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although the shot is very crisp and clear, the bulb to me isn''t a very interesting subject. 5</td>', 'Although the shot is very crisp and clear, the bulb to me isn''t a very interesting subject. 5', '2003-12-28 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(524735, 51631, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL..he''s a cute little guy! Very creative! 7</td>', 'LOL..he''s a cute little guy! Very creative! 7', '2003-12-28 22:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(524737, 51799, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is cool.  Feel like I am a dentist looking into someones throat.  <br/>Very Nice.</td>', 'Wow, that is cool.  Feel like I am a dentist looking into someones throat.  Very Nice.', '2003-12-28 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(524742, 51462, 6668, '<td valign="top">The ear seems a little distorted or pixelated to me, since the title is saphires and diamonds it would have been nice to see the color of the saphires.</td>', 'The ear seems a little distorted or pixelated to me, since the title is saphires and diamonds it would have been nice to see the color of the saphires.', '2003-12-28 22:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(524746, 51824, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, I love how the lines in the petals flow so smoothly at a diagonal. 7</td>', 'Beautiful colors, I love how the lines in the petals flow so smoothly at a diagonal. 7', '2003-12-28 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(524754, 51473, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines and curves of this shot as well as the negative space, it all works well together. 8</td>', 'I really like the lines and curves of this shot as well as the negative space, it all works well together. 8', '2003-12-28 22:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(524759, 51366, 6668, '<td valign="top">Not necessarily....it''s an interesting world out there! :-)</td>', 'Not necessarily....it''s an interesting world out there! :-)', '2003-12-28 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(524766, 51787, 7485, '<td valign="top">Actually, no lens manyfacturer could stay in business selling lenses as shoddy as the one in the human eye! The "perfection" is all in the mind''s eye... But about your photo: excellent focus and DOF, but lighting is too clinical for my taste.</td>', 'Actually, no lens manyfacturer could stay in business selling lenses as shoddy as the one in the human eye! The "perfection" is all in the mind''s eye... But about your photo: excellent focus and DOF, but lighting is too clinical for my taste.', '2003-12-28 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(524767, 51108, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully abstract! I especially like how the vains near the bottom seem to glow.</td>', 'Wonderfully abstract! I especially like how the vains near the bottom seem to glow.', '2003-12-28 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(524768, 51719, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but composition is a bit confusing. Maybe better to crop down to just the one?</td>', 'Great subject, but composition is a bit confusing. Maybe better to crop down to just the one?', '2003-12-28 23:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(524769, 51779, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space in this shot, but I''m not crazy about the glare of the tie pin. 7</td>', 'I like the use of negative space in this shot, but I''m not crazy about the glare of the tie pin. 7', '2003-12-28 23:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(524770, 51624, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white on this shot, it works well, nice composition as well. 10</td>', 'I like the black and white on this shot, it works well, nice composition as well. 10', '2003-12-28 23:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(524772, 51771, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! If only the tip were in focus too...</td>', 'Great idea! If only the tip were in focus too...', '2003-12-28 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(524775, 51691, 12253, '<td valign="top">Clever and very beautiful!  I think it''s almost perfect, but it needs a bit of noise reduction and maybe just a touch of front fill light on the seeds (dark spots)</td>', 'Clever and very beautiful!  I think it''s almost perfect, but it needs a bit of noise reduction and maybe just a touch of front fill light on the seeds (dark spots)', '2003-12-28 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(524776, 51799, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, composition, and overall aesthetics.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, composition, and overall aesthetics.', '2003-12-28 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(524777, 51334, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very different, and very nicely done (lighting, and composition).  Just a little bit of halo-ing or chromatic noise would be good to address.</td>', 'Very different, and very nicely done (lighting, and composition).  Just a little bit of halo-ing or chromatic noise would be good to address.', '2003-12-28 23:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(524782, 51556, 12160, '<td valign="top">I just love the minimalist approach of this photo. The border works really well to blend nicely with the red star that somehow makes the image and the border become one. 8</td>', 'I just love the minimalist approach of this photo. The border works really well to blend nicely with the red star that somehow makes the image and the border become one. 8', '2003-12-28 23:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
