(524935, 51428, 14891, '<td valign="top">I agree with the subject being of political matter. I wanted to see how the members would vote it based upon the "technical" aspects or the "political" aspects of the photo. This was my first entry. I honestly, just put the gun down on a t-shirt on my desk and snapped it on the fully auto mode on the Olympus E-10 with the macro attachment screwed on. Cropped it and then uploaded it. I didn''t mess with anything else. Just pure photo and crop. Thanks for the responses.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-29 03:25:36.</i></td>', 'I agree with the subject being of political matter. I wanted to see how the members would vote it based upon the "technical" aspects or the "political" aspects of the photo. This was my first entry. I honestly, just put the gun down on a t-shirt on my desk and snapped it on the fully auto mode on the Olympus E-10 with the macro attachment screwed on. Cropped it and then uploaded it. I didn''t mess with anything else. Just pure photo and crop. Thanks for the responses.', '2003-12-29 02:18:07.000000', '2003-12-29 03:25:36.000000', 0),
