(525362, 51211, 14773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i>As a guitar player, I  like this shot. I love the cut strings- just seeing them that close reminds me ou the sting of a puncture wound.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I concur, received two lashes last week alone...and I have the same guitar, errr ''had'' the same guitar, just sold it. :-(  The wood finish is beautiful in this shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice:As a guitar player, I  like this shot. I love the cut strings- just seeing them that close reminds me ou the sting of a puncture wound.  I concur, received two lashes last week alone...and I have the same guitar, errr ''had'' the same guitar, just sold it. :-(  The wood finish is beautiful in this shot.', '2003-12-29 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
