(558606, 51715, 8367, '<td valign="top">I hate to see those 0''s for comments!  This is sharp and in focus from edge to edge with just a little difference noted where you cloned (maybe it''s just the color variation).  Not a very appealing photo, but you did a great job capturing it. If it was untitled, I''m afraid I''d be clueless as to what it is, though. I thought it was a topigraphical map. Great macro.</td>', 'I hate to see those 0''s for comments!  This is sharp and in focus from edge to edge with just a little difference noted where you cloned (maybe it''s just the color variation).  Not a very appealing photo, but you did a great job capturing it. If it was untitled, I''m afraid I''d be clueless as to what it is, though. I thought it was a topigraphical map. Great macro.', '2004-01-27 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
